 276: # ================================================================================
 277: # ITEM 1: synthetic negative-example smoke test (launch condition, priority per coordinator)
 278: # Perturb b for a KNOWN-solvable (c=5 i.e. Abar model, m=5) system: b -> b + e_1 (one unit
 279: # outside the image). Confirm GAP's canonical SNF now reports UNSOLVABLE and that a genuine dual
