docs/week4-E2作戦_v2.md-308-古典的事実(Magnus): rank 2 自由群 $F$ について $F'/F''$ は $\mathbb Z[F/F'] = \mathbb Z[s^{\pm1},t^{\pm1}]$ 上の**階数 1 の自由巡回加群**で、生成元は $w = [x,y]$、作用は $a^x = s\cdot a$、$a^y = t\cdot a$(paper 規約 $a^g = g^{-1}ag$)。$s = 1+S$、$t = 1+T$ と置くと $\gamma_j/(\gamma_{j+1}F'')$ は増大イデアル $I = (S,T)$ の $I^{j-2}/I^{j-1}$ に対応し、
docs/week4-E2作戦_v2.md-309-$$ \boxed{\ A_c \;:=\; \gamma_2/(\gamma_{c+1}F'') \;\cong\; \mathbb Z[S,T]/(S,T)^{c-1},\qquad \mathrm{rank} = \tbinom c2 .\ } $$
docs/week4-E2作戦_v2.md:310:辞書: $w = 1$、$p = S$、$q = T$、$r_1 = S^2$、$r_2 = ST\ (= [q,x])$、$r_3 = T^2$。写像は
docs/week4-E2作戦_v2.md:311:$$ \theta:\ f\mapsto -f(T,S),\qquad
docs/week4-E2作戦_v2.md:312:\tau:\ f(s,t)\mapsto f\bigl(t,(st)^{-1}\bigr)\cdot s^{-1},\qquad
docs/week4-E2作戦_v2.md:313:\sigma_m = t^m\cdot\tau, $$
docs/week4-E2作戦_v2.md:314:$$ E_m \;=\; c_m - s^{-m}A_m(s)A_m(st),\quad A_m(u) = 1+u+\cdots+u^{m-1},\quad c_m = t\,A_{m-1}(st)+t\,c_{m-1},\ c_1 = 0 $$
