docs/week4-E2作戦_v1.md-31-
docs/week4-E2作戦_v1.md-32-$N$ を許容対象($c \in N$)、$P := PB_3/N \cong F_2/\bar N$、$A := [P,P]$、$k := \mathrm{ord}(\bar X) = N_{\mathrm{ord}}$、$u := 2m+1$。
docs/week4-E2作戦_v1.md:33:$\theta = \mathrm{Ad}(\bar\Delta)$、$\tau = \mathrm{Ad}(\bar\delta)$(定理 T2(ii))。$A$ 上で
docs/week4-E2作戦_v1.md:34:$$ \sigma(a) \;:=\; \bar Y^{-m}\,\tau(a)\,\bar Y^{m} \;=\; (\tau a)^{\bar Y^m},\qquad
docs/week4-E2作戦_v1.md:35:\mathcal N \;:=\; 1 + \sigma + \sigma^2,\qquad E_m := \tau^2(\bar Y^m)\tau(\bar Y^m)\bar Y^m = \bar X^m\bar Z^m\bar Y^m \in A. $$
docs/week4-E2作戦_v1.md:36:既知(v3 §1.1 F1): $\sigma^3 = \mathrm{Inn}_A(E_m)$、$\sigma(E_m) = E_m$。
docs/week4-E2作戦_v1.md:37:$$ \mathcal B_\theta = \{f\in A : \theta(f) = f^{-1}\},\qquad
docs/week4-E2作戦_v1.md:38:\mathcal S_m = \{f \in A : \mathcal N\text{-方程式 } E_m\mathcal N_m(f) = 1\ \text{の解}\}. $$
docs/week4-E2作戦_v1.md-39-
docs/week4-E2作戦_v1.md:40:> **注意(語規約 W-1 の落とし穴 — 実装者へ)**: paper の $a^g := g^{-1}ag$ は、規約 W-1(paper 語 "AB" ↔ GAP `B*A`)の下で **GAP では `a^(g^-1)`** になる。**共役も向きが反転する。** $\sigma$ を GAP で書くときはここで必ず一度間違える。§3.4 の適合テストを先に通すこと。
